# Skyforge — Act XII: The Charter's Court (35 quests + recurring loop).
# TONE: Steampunk colonial. The Federation is comfortable; the Charter
# itself has politics. Two factions (Reformers, Traditionalists). A
# rogue Administrator (Cornelius Vanguard). The Eldritch Tide. A
# repeatable Court Cycle that resets every 7 in-game days.
# THEME BIBLE: This is the escalation. Internal threat, not external.
# The Charter is a flawed institution. The Foreman has to choose.
# TODO verify Iron's Spellbooks Eldritch tier IDs + Cataclysm bosses.

